/E (AArtificial intelligence \(AI\) has progressed to the point where interaction with a chatbot can be indistinguishable from interaction with a human. Chatbots are designed to maximize user retention, and as a result they are prone to manipulation, sycophancy, and the reinforcement of delusional thought patterns. This technology comes with great risks, particularly to children. )
